      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the additional context Yuval.\n\n\u003e I don\u0027t think we should block this CL on that because it would require a massive restructuring of the code.\n\nYeah, I definitely don\u0027t want to block this CL on that. However, since this is the first of a bunch of tests that are being migrating over from EC, I wanted to see if there\u0027s some way that we can indicate whether a test is a unit test or integration test. Even if that\u0027s only a comment in the test source file, I think that will make it easier to refactor in the future as well as make the purpose of a given test clearer in the short term.",
